24]\n\n60) Path of Life (生存航路) [29 November 2024]\n\n61) Adventure That Cannot Wait for the Sun (太陽すらも追い越して) [12 January 2025]\n\n62) A Kazdelian Rescue (溶炉『還魂』 譚) [4 February 2025]\n\n63) Ending a Grand Overture (落日の向こうへ) [4 April 2025]\n\n64) I Portatori dei Velluti (幕開く者たち) [19 April 2025]\n\n65) Exodus from the Pale Sea (白き海の彼方へ) [30 May 2025]\n\n66) Such is the Joy of Our Reunion (相見歓) [9 July 2025]\n\n67) See You Soon (また明日) [4 August 2025]\n\n68) When Elegies Are Ashes (挽歌が灰に還る時) [25 August 2025]\n\n69) Dissociative Recombination (第十五章「解離結合」) [12 September 2025] \n\n70) The Masses'' Travels (命ある者の旅) [7 October 2025] \n\n71) Act or Die (緋染めのビロード) [10 November 2025] \n\n72) Fantasy in the Mirage (鏡中集) [9 December 2025] \n\n73) Ato (墟) [10 January 2026] \n\n74) Abnormal Spectrum (第十六章「背理分光」) [17 March 2026] \n\n75) Retracing Our Steps 1101 (聖山降臨1101) [8 April 2026] \n\n76) Unrealized Realities (約束されざる地) [15 May 2026] \n\n77) Medjehtiqedti Bound (テヌス復讐記) [19 June 2026] \n\n78) First of A Thousand Autumns (辞歳行) [9 July 2026] \n\n79) Crossing (十字路) [10 August 2026] \n\n80) People, A People (人々、我々) [12 September 2026] \n\n81) Critical Phase Transition (第十七章「相変臨界」) [7 October 2026]','\n',char(10)),7.2,'SPECIAL',1,0,'1 min','Yostar Pictures','-','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx119080-z78DHgQr0ovq.jpg','["Action","Fantasy","Sci-Fi"]',2721,1794782800,0,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(119661,42203,'Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu 2nd Season Part 2','Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 2 Part 2',replace('After learning more behind the Death Loop and Witches of Sin, Subaru vows to save Emilia and his friends from further doom.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),8.4,'TV',2,0,'30 min','WHITE FOX','WINTER 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx119661-GDbUZxrZMz01.png','["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"]',317410,1794735119,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(120120,42249,'Tokyo Revengers','Tokyo Revengers',replace('Takemichi Hanagaki is a freelancer that''s reached the absolute pits of despair in his life. He finds out that the only girlfriend he ever had in his life that he dated in middle school, Hinata Tachibana, had been killed by the ruthless Tokyo Manji Gang.\n\n\n\nThe day after hearing about her death, he''s standing on the station platform and ends up being pushed over onto the tracks by a herd of people. He closes his eyes thinking he''s about to die, but when he opens his eyes back up, he somehow had gone back in time 12 years.\n\n\n\nNow that he''s back living the best days of his life, Takemichi decides to get revenge on his life by saving his girlfriend and changing himself that he''d been running away from.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),7.7,'TV',2,0,'24 min','LIDENFILMS','SPRING 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx120120-cWDmnmeEntSe.jpg','["Action","Drama","Romance","Supernatural"]',455118,1794735119,24,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(120377,42310,'Cyberpunk: Edgerunners','Cyberpunk: Edgerunners',replace('Cyberpunk: Edgerunners tells a standalone, 10-episode story about a street kid trying to survive in a technology and body modification-obsessed city of the future. Having everything to lose, he chooses to stay alive by becoming an edgerunner—a mercenary outlaw also known as a cyberpunk.\n\n\n\n(Source: CD PROJEKT RED)\n\n\n\nNote: The first episode received a pre-screening at Anime Expo on July 2, 2022. The first 3 dubbed episodes were streamed on Twitch as part of a co-stream promotion on September 12, a day before the show’s premiere.','\n',char(10)),8.5,'ONA',2,0,'24 min','TRIGGER','SUMMER 2022','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx120377-ayZPoxiWt4Li.jpg','["Action","Drama","Psychological","Sci-Fi"]',411120,1794735119,10,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(120697,42361,'Ijiranaide, Nagatoro-san','DON''T TOY WITH ME, MISS NAGATORO',replace('"A girl in a lower grade just made me cry!"\n\n\n\nOne day, Senpai visits the library after school and becomes the target of a super sadistic junior! The name of the girl who teases, torments, and tantalizes Senpai is "Nagatoro!" She''s annoying yet adorable. It''s painful, but you still want to be by her side. This is a story about an extremely sadistic and temperamental girl and you''ll feel something awaken inside of you.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),6.9,'TV',2,0,'24 min','Telecom Animation Film','SPRING 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx120697-BA2TqxB1I5bJ.jpg','["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"]',272695,1794735119,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(124080,42897,'Horimiya','Horimiya',replace('A secret life is the one thing they have in common. At school, Hori is a prim and perfect social butterfly, but the truth is she''s a brash homebody. Meanwhile, under a gloomy facade, Miyamura hides a gentle heart, along with piercings and tattoos. In a chance meeting, they both reveal a side they''ve never shown. Could this blossom into something new?\n\n\n\n(Source: Funimation)','\n',char(10)),8.1,'TV',2,0,'24 min','CloverWorks','WINTER 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124080-3i22mRVPBS0T.jpg','["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"]',556113,1794735119,13,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(124082,55351,'Azur Lane Anime PVs','アズールレーン アニメPVs',replace('Assorted commercials for the Azur Lane Mobile Game posted on the official Youtube channel. The animation is unique to these commercials and is not present in the game nor in the TV Series.\n\n\n\nThe list of the commercials is as follows (note that CMs without animation are not present and, for the ones with long and short versions, the longer version is taken into consideration):\n\n\n\n1) 縹映る深緋の残響篇 (17 April 2020) \n\n2) 神穹を衝く聖歌 (19 May 2020) \n\n3) 極夜照らす幻光 (23 July 2020) \n\n4) アズールレーン 25時間生放送アニメ制作マラソンPV (13 September 2020) \n\n5) 激唱のユニバース (28 October 2020) \n\n6) 「アズールレーン」×「DEAD OR ALIVE Xtreme Venus Vacation」コラボ (18 November 2020) \n\n7) 虚畳なりし限象 (21 December 2020) \n\n8) 暁射す氷華の嵐 (21 February 2021) \n\n9) 讃える復興の迷路 (19 April 2021) \n\n10) ニュージャージー (23 May 2021) \n\n11) 「アズールレーン」×「THE IDOLM@STER」コラボ (26 July 2021) \n\n12) 島風 (14 September 2021) \n\n13) 「アズールレーン | SSSS.GRIDMAN / SSSS.DYNAZENON」コラボ (20 November 2021)\n\n14) 遡望せし虹彩の塔 (30 December 2021) \n\n15) 鳴動せし星霜の淵 (18 February 2022) \n\n16) 誠閃の剣　搖光の城 (22 May 2022) \n\n17) 赫の涙月　菫の暁風 (12 September 2022) \n\n18) 「アズールレーン」×「ライザのアトリエ２」「ライザのアトリエ３」コラボ (18 November 2022) \n\n19) 積重なる事象の幻界 (16 December 2022) \n\n20) 黙示の遺構 (20 February 2023) \n\n21) 覆天せし万象の塵 (19 May 2023) \n\n22) 愚者の天秤 (13 August 2023) \n\n23) 須臾望月抄 (13 September 2023) \n\n24) 「アズールレーン」×「シノビマスター 閃乱カグラ NEW LINK」 (11 November 2023) \n\n25) 光追う星の海 (15 December 2023) \n\n26) 銀界遊廻 (23 February 2024) \n\n27) 共鳴のパッション (19 April 2024) \n\n28) 赫輝のマルティリウム (17 May 2024) \n\n29) トキメク休日大航海 (22 May 2024) \n\n30) カウガール着せ替えシリーズ2024編 (11 August 2024) \n\n31) 絳染む丹華の詠歌 (7 September 2024) \n\n32) 周年着せ替えシリーズ第一弾 (12 September 2024) \n\n33) 星降る夕影の残光 (16 December 2024) \n\n34) 冬の着せ替え第2弾 (26 December 2024) \n\n35) 春節着せ替えシリーズ2025 (20 January 2025) \n\n36) 籠檻に囚われし神光 (23 February 2025) \n\n37) 2025年2月着せ替えシリーズ (25 February 2025) \n\n38) 高い塔の薔薇 (20 May 2025) \n\n39) 初夏着せ替え2025 (27 May 2025) \n\n40) アマハラに舞い奉れ (6 September 2025) \n\n41) 激戦！忍者の城 (7 September 2025) \n\n42) 天穹に響く音謡 (17 December 2025) \n\n43) 新年着せ替えシリーズ2026 (22 December 2025) \n\n44) 春色旅籠Online (27 February 2026) \n\n45) ワンダラー募集計画 (24 March 2026) \n\n46) 聖印前の同盟 (16 May 2026) \n\n47) 初夏着せ替えシリーズ2026 (24 May 2026) \n\n48) 周年着せ替え2026 (5 September 2026) \n\n49) 妖異奇譚 (7 September 2026)','\n',char(10)),6.3,'SPECIAL',1,0,'1 min','MADHOUSE','-','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124082-ex34xC20rmHW.png','["Action","Slice of Life"]',1827,1794782800,0,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(124153,42923,'SK∞','SK8 the Infinity',replace('Reki, a high school sophomore and skater, is addicted to “S,” a highly secret and dangerous downhill skateboarding race that takes place in an abandoned mine. The skaters are especially wild about the “beefs,” or heated battles that erupt in the races.\n\n\n\nReki takes Langa, a transfer student returning to Japan after studying abroad, to the mine where the races are held. Langa, who has no skateboarding experience, finds himself pulled into the world of “S”...\n\n\n\n(Source: Aniplex of America)\n\n\n\nNote: On March 13, 2021 a recap episode (9.5) went on air, postponing the broadcast of the regular episodes by one week.','\n',char(10)),7.9,'TV',2,0,'24 min','bones','WINTER 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124153-uEBI764OSavB.png','["Action","Drama","Sports"]',238420,1794735119,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(124194,42938,'Fruits Basket: The Final','Fruits Basket The Final Season',replace('After last season’s revelations, the Soma family moves forward, but the emotional chains that bind them are not easily broken. Unable to admit why she wants the cure, Tohru wrestles with the truth, aware that time is running out for someone close.\n\n\n\nAnd a secret still lurks that could break another’s heart. But hope is not lost—a clue to the curse is found. Could their imprisonment’s end be near?\n\n\n(Source: Funimation)\n\n\nNote: This season premiered on Funimation and AnimeLab on March 20, 2021. The Japanese broadcast started two weeks later on April 6, 2021.','\n',char(10)),8.9,'TV',2,0,'24 min','TMS Entertainment','SPRING 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124194-TJlqMMR7BGn9.jpg','["Comedy","Drama","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life","Supernatural"]',179923,1794735120,13,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(124845,43299,'Wonder Egg Priority','WONDER EGG PRIORITY',replace('This is the story of Ai, an introverted girl whose fate is forever changed when she acquires a mysterious “Wonder Egg” from a deserted arcade. That night, her dreams blend into reality, and as other girls obtain their own Wonder Eggs, Ai discovers new friends—and the magic within herself.\n\n\n\n(Source: Funimation)','\n',char(10)),7.4,'TV',2,0,'23 min','CloverWorks','WINTER 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124845-JXORhqCTGt04.jpg','["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Psychological","Sci-Fi","Thriller"]',288907,1794735119,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(125206,43523,'Tsuki ga Michibiku Isekai Douchuu','TSUKIMICHI -Moonlit Fantasy-',replace('Makoto Misumi was just an average teenager who happened to suddenly be summoned to another world as a "hero." But the goddess of this world called him ugly and took his hero status away from him then sent him to the ends of the world. In the wastelands, he meets dragons, spiders, orcs, dwarves and many other non-human races. Makoto manages to show promises in the use of magic and fighting, which he wouldn''t have been able to do in his former world. He has numerous encounters, but will he be able to survive this new world? A fantasy where a guy who had been abandoned by gods and humanity tries to reset his life in this new world is about to begin!\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),7.7,'TV',2,0,'24 min','C2C','SUMMER 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx125206-O2MsOWdW1lVi.jpg','["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"]',179290,1794735120,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(125367,43608,'Kaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai: Ultra Romantic','Kaguya-sama: Love is War -Ultra Romantic-',replace('The elite members of Shuchiin Academy''s student council continue their competitive day-to-day antics. Council president Miyuki Shirogane clashes daily against vice-president Kaguya Shinomiya, each fighting tooth and nail to trick the other into confessing their romantic love. Kaguya struggles within the strict confines of her wealthy, uptight family, rebelling against her cold default demeanor as she warms to Shirogane and the rest of her friends.\n\n\n\nMeanwhile, council treasurer Yuu Ishigami suffers under the weight of his hopeless crush on Tsubame Koyasu, a popular upperclassman who helps to instill a new confidence in him. Miko Iino, the newest student council member, grows closer to the rule-breaking Ishigami while striving to overcome her own authoritarian moral code.\n\n\n\nAs love further blooms at Shuchiin Academy, the student council officers drag their outsider friends into increasingly comedic conflicts.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\n\n\nNote: The first episode had an advanced screening on April 2, in both New York & Los Angeles.','\n',char(10)),8.9,'TV',2,0,'24 min','A-1 Pictures','SPRING 2022','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx125367-1yuq9NFcQuLI.png','["Comedy","Psychological","Romance","Slice of Life"]',298878,1794735119,13,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(126403,44074,'Shiguang Dailiren','Link Click',replace('In a corner of a bustling city, there is a small shop called "Time Photo Studio"  operating as usual. Although the entrance looks abandoned, it''s actually run by two men with special abilities: Cheng Xiaoshi and Lu Guang. In order to fulfil customers'' requests, Lu Guang and Cheng Xiaoshi work together and use their special abilities to enter photos. However, things don''t go as planned...\n\n\n\n(Source: bilibili, translated)\n\n\n\nNote: The final episode aired with a runtime of ~31 minutes.','\n',char(10)),8.6,'ONA',2,0,'24 min','Studio LAN','-','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx126403-BfVSRzWUtVFW.png','["Drama","Mystery","Supernatural","Thriller"]',181183,1794735120,11,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(127230,44511,'Chainsaw Man','Chainsaw Man',replace('Denji is a teenage boy living with a Chainsaw Devil named Pochita. Due to the debt his father left behind, he has been living a rock-bottom life while repaying his debt by harvesting devil corpses with Pochita.\n\n\nOne day, Denji is betrayed and killed. As his consciousness fades, he makes a contract with Pochita and gets revived as "Chainsaw Man" — a man with a devil''s heart.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),8.3,'TV',2,0,'25 min','MAPPA','FALL 2022','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx127230-DdP4vAdssLoz.png','["Action","Drama","Horror","Supernatural"]',652988,1794735119,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(127720,45576,'Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu Part 2','Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Cour 2',replace('After the mysterious mana calamity, Rudeus Greyrat and his fierce student Eris Boreas Greyrat are teleported to the Demon Continent. There, they team up with their newfound companion Ruijerd Supardia—the former leader of the Superd''s Warrior group—to form "Dead End," a successful adventurer party. Making a name for themselves, the trio journeys across the continent to make their way back home to Fittoa.\n\n\n\nFollowing the advice he received from the faceless god Hitogami, Rudeus saves Kishirika Kishirisu, the Great Emperor of the Demon World, who rewards him by granting him a strange power. Now, as Rudeus masters the powerful ability that offers a number of new opportunities, it might prove to be more than what he bargained for when unexpected dangers threaten to hinder their travels.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)','\n',char(10)),8.5,'TV',2,0,'24 min','Studio Bind','FALL 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx127720-ADJgIrUVMdU9.jpg','["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"]',334740,1794735119,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(127911,45613,'Kawaii dake ja Nai Shikimori-san','Shikimori''s Not Just a Cutie',replace('The ultimate "heartthrob girlfriend" appears! Naturally unlucky high school student Izumi''s girlfriend is his classmate Shikimori. She has a beautiful smile and kind personality and always seems happy when she''s with Izumi. She''s a pretty, cute, and loving girlfriend, but when Izumi''s in trouble… she transforms into a super cool "heartthrob girlfriend!" The fun lives of the cute and cool Shikimori, Izumi, and their good friends never end!\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),6.8,'TV',2,0,'23 min','Doga Kobo','SPRING 2022','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx127911-qfJDzUt0qCna.jpg','["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"]',221944,1794735120,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(128394,48442,'Shikaruneko','しかるねこ',replace('The official Twitter account for manga creator agency wwwaap''s Shikaruneko (Angry Cat) character announced on January 5 that the character is inspiring a mini-anime. The anime will premiere this spring on TV Tokyo.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)','\n',char(10)),0,'TV_SHORT',1,0,'1 min','-','SPRING 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx128394-hNrBsBhqj50E.jpg','["Slice of Life"]',534,1794782800,0,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(128546,46095,'Vivy: Fluorite Eye’s Song','Vivy -Fluorite Eye''s Song-',replace('An AI named Matsumoto appears before Vivy, the world’s first autonomous humanoid AI. Matsumoto’s mission is to rewrite history together with Vivy, in order to stop the war between AI and humans that will happen one century later.\n\n\n\n(Source: Funimation)','\n',char(10)),8.2,'TV',2,0,'23 min','WIT STUDIO','SPRING 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx128546-UIwyhuhjxmL0.jpg','["Action","Drama","Music","Sci-Fi","Thriller"]',184072,1794735120,13,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(128893,46569,'Jigokuraku','Hell’s Paradise',replace('The Edo period is nearing its end. Gabimaru, a shinobi formerly known as the strongest in Iwagakure who is now a death row convict, is told that he will be acquitted and set free if he can bring back the Elixir of Life from an island that is rumored to be the Buddhist pure land Sukhavati. In hopes of reuniting with his beloved wife, Gabimaru heads to the island along with the executioner Yamada Asaemon Sagiri. Upon arriving there, they encounter other death row convicts in search of the Elixir of Life... as well as a host of unknown creatures, eerie manmade statues, and the hermits who rule the island. Can Gabimaru find the Elixir of Life on this mysterious island and make it back home alive?\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),8,'TV',2,0,'24 min','MAPPA','SPRING 2023','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx128893-Gc2t8b8M0mVu.jpg','["Action","Adventure","Mystery","Supernatural"]',373573,1794735119,13,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(129201,47194,'Summer Time Render','Summer Time Rendering',replace('A sci-fi, summer story filled with suspense set on a small island with Shinpei Aijiro, whose childhood friend Ushio Kofune died. He returns to his hometown for the first time in two years for the funeral. Sou Hishigata, his best friend, suspects something''s off with Ushio''s death, and that someone can die next. \n\n\n\nA sinister omen is heard as an entire family next door suddenly disappears the following day. Furthermore, Mio implicates a "shadow" three days before Ushio''s death. \n\n\n\n(Source: Disney+)','\n',char(10)),8.3,'TV',2,0,'24 min','OLM','SPRING 2022','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx129201-HJBauga2be8I.png','["Action","Drama","Mystery","Supernatural","Thriller"]',231904,1794735119,25,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(129874,49926,'Kimetsu no Yaiba: Mugen Ressha-hen (TV)','Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Mugen Train Arc',replace('In Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Mugen Train Arc, Tanjiro Kamado and his fellow Demon Slayer members embark on a mission aboard the Infinity Train. Their new mission is to investigate a series of mysterious disappearances, carried out by a demon that has been terrorizing passengers and killing the demon slayers who oppose it.\n\n\n\nNote: The first episode is entirely anime original. Episodes 2-7 are a re-edited version of the movie featuring new scenes and music.','\n',char(10)),8.2,'TV',2,0,'23 min','ufotable','FALL 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx129874-g6ZKXB94Hui1.jpg','["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Supernatural"]',370218,1794735119,7,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(129898,47790,'Sekai Saikou no Ansatsusha, Isekai Kizoku ni Tensei suru','The World''s Finest Assassin Gets Reincarnated in Another World as an Aristocrat',replace('The world''s number one assassin has been reincarnated as the eldest son of a family of aristocrat assassins. In exchange for being reincarnated in another world, a goddess has imposed upon him one condition. "Kill the Hero who is prophesied to destroy the world." \n\n\n\nThis was to be the mission in his new life. The synergistic effect of the vast knowledge and experience he gained that made all manner of assassinations possible in the modern world, and the secret techniques and magic of the fantasy world''s most powerful family of assassins turn him into the greatest assassin of all time.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),7.2,'TV',2,0,'24 min','SILVER LINK.','FALL 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx129898-FRUzDtPhRigt.jpg','["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Romance"]',209903,1794735120,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(129963,47904,'HOLOLIVE ALTERNATIVE Teaser PVs','『ホロライブ・オルタナティブ』 ティザーPVs',replace('Welcome to an alternative world. \n\nAnother possibility for hololive: hololive △lternative\n\n\n\n(Source: YouTube description)\n\n\n\nIncludes:\n\nNote: A 30-second sneak peek of the first PV was previously released on February 17, 2021.  \n\n1) 『ホロライブ・オルタナティブ』 ティザーPV（Fullver）/ [hololive Alternative] Teaser PV (full ver.), released May 21 2021.\n\n2) 『ホロライブ・オルタナティブ』 2ndティザーPV / [hololive Alternative] 2nd Teaser, released June 11, 2022.','\n',char(10)),7.8,'ONA',1,0,'2 min','-','SPRING 2021','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx129963-mJHVwkn9NFoz.png','["Fantasy"]',5690,1794782800,0,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(130003,47917,'Bocchi the Rock!','BOCCHI THE ROCK!',replace('Hitori Gotou, “Bocchi-chan,” is a girl who’s so introverted and shy around people that she’d always start her conversations with “Ah...”\n\n\n\nDuring her middle school years, she started playing the guitar, wanting to join a band because she thought it could be an opportunity for even someone shy like her to also shine. But because she had no friends, she ended up practicing guitar for six hours every day all by herself. After becoming a skilled guitar player, she uploaded videos of herself playing the guitar to the internet under the name “Guitar Hero” and fantasized about performing at her school’s cultural festival concert. But not only could she not find any bandmates, before she knew it, she was in high school and still wasn’t able to make a single friend!\n\n\n\nShe was really close to becoming a shut-in, but one day, Nijika Ijichi, the drummer in Kessoku Band, reached out to her. And because of that, her everyday life started to change little by little...\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)','\n',char(10)),8.7,'TV',2,0,'24 min','CloverWorks','FALL 2022','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx130003-HTDmeL4RGeJ4.png','["Comedy","Music","Slice of Life"]',274037,1794735119,12,0,0);
INSERT INTO "animes" ("id","mal_id","title","title_alt","synopsis","score","type","status","schedule_day","duration","studio","release_season","poster_url","genres_json","popularity","updated_at","episodes_total","next_airing_at","next_airing_ep") VALUES(130298,48316,'Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!','The Eminence in Shadow',replace('Some people just aren’t suited to playing the part of the flashy, in-your-face hero or the dastardly, mustache-twirling villain with larger-than-life panache. Instead, they operate in the shadows and pull the strings of society through wit and cleverness. That’s the role Cid wants to play when he’s transported to another world. Cid spins a yarn or three and becomes the unlikely leader of the underground Shadow Garden organization that fights against a menacing cult (which he totally made up). However, there’s a catch even his wild imagination didn’t see coming: the cult he concocted actually exists, and they’re beyond displeased that his power fantasy just got in the way of their evil plans!\n\n\n\n(Source: HIDIVE)','\n',char(10)),8.1,'TV',2,0,'24 min','Nexus','FALL 2022','https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx130298-YMdcKHytpWNH.jpg','["Action","Comedy","Fantasy"]',325614,1794735119,20,0,0);
